<title>POLAND: POLIFARB-W JUNE NET RISES TO PLN 3.3 MLN.</title>
<headline>POLIFARB-W JUNE NET RISES TO PLN 3.3 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results June</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JUNE		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     3.30 vs   3.03</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 4.79 vs   4.71</p>
<p> Operating profit     4.80 vs   4.20</p>
<p> Sales		   25.58 vs  22.59</p>
<p> JANUARY-JUNE	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	    11.60 vs  10.89</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	17.98 vs  17.48</p>
<p> Operating profit    17.78 vs  16.03</p>
<p> Sales		  113.97 vs 103.73</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish paint maker is Polifarb</p>
<p>Wroclaw SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
